|---|---|
| `python3 main.py.c N` / `gcc` + `cmain N` (your exact commands) | both print `f(40) = 102334155` |
| Differential, 84 N values (0–60 plus 61…100000) | 0 mismatches |
| Independent oracle (matrix power, 45 values incl. random) | 0 mismatches |
| Cassini `f(n-1)f(n+1)-f(n)²=(-1)ⁿ`, `gcd(f(n),f(n+1))=1`, `n|m ⟹ f(n)|f(m)` | 0 violations |
| `gcc -Wall -Wextra` | no output |
